WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.079
Can a joke use AI to put words in a
leader's mouth? Two courts, two answers.

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.507
Berlin, 2024: a court banned an AI video
of the chancellor: not clearly satire.

00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:18.936
California, 2024: a parody ad gave a candidate
an AI voice. A new law demanded a label.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:25.364
A judge struck the law down: answer a joke
with more speech, not a ban.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:31.943
EU law since August: AI fakes need a label.
For satire, one that won't spoil the joke.
